@startuml SD06_Admin_ChangeUserPermission
hide footbox
title SD06 Admin Changes User Permission

actor AdminUser as SystemAdminUser
participant App as ShopRentalApplication
participant Admin as SystemAdmin

AdminUser -> App: choose Change user permission
App -> App: input targetUserId + permission text
App -> Admin: changeUserPermission(userId, permission)
Admin --> App: updated
App -> App: saveStateQuietly()
App --> AdminUser: Permission updated and saved
@enduml